<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,011-970 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten dow Tara Chet Miuüa pami bowih chowng kowi kowh lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Moab chenchap masiuüa Ruth dow Israel chenchap kachakuüa lowk ia hown tachawng khai. Ruth dow Jihudi chenchap nadowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Thurai kowi Israeluüa nuata mih khin khe aia kowh owmra dow amatni tut-e iiu dawng kowi kowh anowi iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruth bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow, “Tasin taken mih maru kham kurdik mih,” pami chekhai (Levi 25:13-55).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruth kowh hua hown lang tasin taken mih maru dow Boaz chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Boaz mih Ruth kowh kowng mih hua kowh laih ranta pe khai. Now Ruth dow ahua kowng kung kowi nami Boaz hown tachawng khai. Now aia dow Boaz hown ta ka chah hanow ahua kowng mih kowh ming ta town pe khai. (Nami lawnguan kowi kowh rirow dow Plan Rui 25:5-10 uan kowi arui uowi chekhai).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh pankrima mih lawnguan dow David kowh pipu-uüa lawnguan uang tek krowngchow mih nadowi. David hai Isu kowh pipu-uüa chownglawng kowi awdara uowima Thurai chang lup mih lawnguan paw arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Tachawng: Tachawng pami laiklow dow auan uowi pre chaing chekhai. Lowk dow masiuüa hown kachakuüa tapün talo mih, now alowk mih auan dow maru lowk ia kowi alowk mih maru hawt chawngah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruth kowi pawla now Jerusalem kowi Naomi plan mih 1:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Boaz hown Ruth kowtakrum mih 2:1-3:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Boaz hown Ruth tachawng mih 4:1-22</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Naomi kowh iaumow Ruth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1-2" />Tara chet miuüa kruitown pren mih khin khe Israel pren kowi mih <char style="w">khown</char> kuak pakat chekhai. Nami khin khe Judauüa süng kowi kowh Bethlehem marow kowi Efrat krungchak Elimelek pami maru uowi lowk ia. Amasi ming dow Naomi chekhai, now achapa pre ia ming dow Malawn hai Kiliawn iüah chekhai. Israel pren kowi khown kuak rakowi aia dow amasi hai achapa pre ia kowi pawla now Moab pren kowi nakowuowi tak kownkow kowpowt khai.<verse eid="RUT 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Moab pren kowi uowi büah khe Elimelek dow kowng khai. Now ta uowi mih dow Naomi hai achapa pre iachow towbowt chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Now ahua kowng kung kowi Naomi dow achapa pre ia kowi ta paw pe masi khai. Achapa pre ia kowh masi dow Moab prenchak masiuüa chekhai. Lowk ia mih ming dow Awrpa, now alowk mih ming dow Ruth chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Nachenganchepaw Moab pren kowi amatni uowi mih hamüt ning ngia kung kowi Malawn hai Kiliawn iüah dow kowng khai. Nami hownia bowt now Naomi dow aia malowkchow towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Moab pren kowi uowi reng tak khe Naomi dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa kowi khowngah mih hai peah chakkham mih satang tawi ta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia mih aiaumow pre ia kowi pawla now Moab pren hownia aia kim prakowi namang kownkow kamrüt khai bowt. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Aia dow aiaumow pre ia kowi pawla now Moab pren hownia lawt khai bowt, now Juda pren prakowi kowh mangla mih tiama kowi mang büah khai bowt.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Tiama rawng kowi aiaumow pre ia kowi Naomi tek pe mih, “Enching matia u-pa kim kowi plan iüa diah towbowt. Enching kowh hua kowng mih hai ang kowi enching saksing sana iawng CHAKRAMANG paw pacham saksing sana enching lah. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Thaulangma hown hua kim kowi enching naplan ka uowila iawk kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe enching prasi lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Naiawng ki tek pe hanow aia dow aiaumow pre ia kowi nam pe awm khai, now aiaumow pre ia dow atün atünma kar khai. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Nakhowk khe aiaumow pre ia tek pe mih, “Lan kown angching nau dowi. En hown en kowh chenchapuüa tut-e angching tawi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Now Naomi tek pe mih, “Naiawng nadowi iauchow iüah low, enching matia u-pa kim kowi phai kowlan iüa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow ang hown enching natawi kown? Enching nachangla hua kownkow ang naplan ka enching chapa iawk kown mih enching ming bow? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12-13" />Naiawng nadowi iauchow iüah low, enching matia u-pa kim kowi phai kowlan iüa diah. Ang kowh dow nacham mang iawk kown mih ning uowi dowi bowt. Naka chah iawk kown mih sakowmra hown aiak ang hua hown ang tawi taphak khowm padow ang kowh chah iuk dowi mowr enching nowng chawng kown pabow? Naiawng nadowi, kim kowi phai kowplan iüa diah towbowt. Enchi kowi tawngpaw ang tawi nowng khowng enchi dowi rakowi lainowmma ang sak kowi rau khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kingküa ang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 1:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Nami laiklow tata hanow aiaumow pre ia dow atün atünma kar khai iawk. Nami kung kowi Awrpa dow anowkaw kowi namla pe awm now aia kim prakowi mang khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Ruth dow anowkaw kowi plawtah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Nakhowk khe Ruth kowi Naomi tek pe mih, “Mü madiah, en naumow dow aia maru-uüa tut-e hai aia kowh thuraiuüa tut-e mang khowk. En paw aia iawng tawi mang towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Nachenganchepaw Ruth klangah mih, “Napowtta en kownkow kür hown hauang chin ang diah, now en hown natawi kown mih paw hauang hang ang diah. En cham kowi rah kowi ang paw natawi kown, now en cham uowi rah kowi ang paw natawi uowi kown. En kowh maru-uüa dow ang kowh maru-uüa pachowng lah, now en kowh Thurai dow ang kowh Thurai pachowng lah. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />En cham kowng rah kowi ang paw natawi kowng kown, now en tadupra kowi ang kowi paw maru mih pacham dup ang lah. Kowngra klen kowi dow miapaw hang pacham prai achi lah. Kowng dowi rawn che ang powtta en khai hanow CHAKRAMANG mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Nami laiklow tata hanow aia tut-e Ruth natawi ngengche kown nau mih Naomi tukta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi nami hownia bowt now Ruth kowi tawngpaw Naomi tek pe dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Nami kung kowi amatchi dow mang mang now Bethlehem marow kowi kowting iüah khai bowt. Bethlehem marow kowi kowting iüah mih khin khe kuachakuüa dow lainowmma hawt awda hai awmrawm khai. Kuachak masiuüa hawmh tatek mih, “Naomi nadowi bow paimi?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi tek pe mih, “Naomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Naomi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow apiaw apama pami chekhai.</char></note> pahai hauang haw ang büah tham bowt. Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow akhakma pami chekhai.</char></note> pahai haw ang büah rowt diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow ang kowh chownglawng akhakma changta ang khai bowt. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Mami hownia Moab pren kowi ang kowkowi khe dow ang kowh uowi bowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow akhaw aklaima hown uang pe plan ang khai. CHAKRAMANG lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow kingküa ang hai towk ang ngare khai. Naiawng CHAKRAMANG chang ang khowk chepaw tawngplawng kowchow Naomi pahai enni tuk haw ang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Naiawng hai Naomi dow aiaumow Ruth hown Moab pren hownia uang plan mang khai. Amatchi dow uown ngen iakmow thüm khe Bethlehem marow kowi uang ting iüah khai.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ruth hai Boaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi kowh dow ahua Elimelek hown kowh tasin taken mih maru uowi lowk ia chekhai. Aming dow Boaz chekhai, now aia dow kurengma hai ringkawra uowima mih maru chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Akat khe anowkaw Naomi kowi Moab chenchap Ruth tek pe mih, “Laih kowi kowh dowh mih iakmow püi ang cham kua ü? Saksing sana ang kowh pe kua ang mih kung kowi chowtaih ang nakrawi kua kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Naomi tek pe mih, “Ow, cham kua bowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Naiawng rakowi Ruth dow cham tarü khai, now laih kowi ngen iakmow miuüa kung kowi aia dow krawi kua iakmow püi khai. Aia krawi kua pe iakmow püi mih laih dow atarang Elimelek hown tasin taken mih Boaz kowh chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Naiawng Ruth tawi kua iakmow mih khin khe Boaz dow Bethlehem hownia nami laih kowi uang khai. Now ngen iakmow miuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG pacham pe enni prasi lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Ngen iakmow miuüa klangah mih, “En kowi paw CHAKRAMANG pacham pe en prasi lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Ngen iakmow miuüa kowi kowh aluchow kowi Boaz lüntaah mih, “Nami malauüa dow mia kowh chama chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Nakhowk khe nami aluchow tek pe mih, “Nami malauüa dow Moab pren hownia Naomi hown kowh uang tawi mih Moab chenchap chowbowt. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Nami masiuüa tek mih, ‘Sakrauma hown enni ngenah mih iakmow cheng hownia kowh ta dowh mih iakmow püi dow krawi pe kua ang büa diah,’ pah anging khai. Naiawng hai aia dow rauchow hownia kawmat mowr pat krawi kua reng tak chekhai; ni chut kowi tanai nawngchow ni!” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Nakhowk khe Boaz tek pe Ruth mih, “Sakrauma hown sünta diah. En mih nacham kua iakmow püi kownkow akeng laih kowi hang cham kowi tham bowt ba. Ang kowh lup chang mih masiuüa hawmh hown tawi uowi towbowt. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Masiuüa hawmh ngen pe iakmow mih re-e krawi müah kaneu now amatni kung kowi krawi kua now na towbowt. Klanguüa hawmh nachang en naklak dowi kownkow amatni kowi ang tek pe khowk. En tui sakkrai now amatni uang towngla mih tui tawi kham taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Ruth dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se Boaz kowi chupah khai. Now tek pe mih, “Ang dow prenlang maru chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow towsak towtaima hown en saksing sana ang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Nakhowk khe Boaz klangah mih, “En hua kowng kung kowi en nawkaw vüi en chang mih maten dow ang ta chekhai. Nami klen kowi en u en pa hai en dia rah pren ta towla now tukah dowi mih chenchap pungmadawng kowi en uang tawi uowi khai pami paw ang ta. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Naiawng rakowi en changah mih lup sung dow tataing iawng CHAKRAMANG pacham pe en lah. CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tut-e en uang tatung tanim khowk chedow aia mih en kowh kakbak maten achima pacham pe en lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Nakhowk khe Ruth tek mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, en dow saksing sana ang khai. Ang dow en kowh narma paw nadowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en tek ang sakkhawtra lai hai en pe ang sakklamra khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Now chak khin khe Boaz tek pe Ruth mih, “Mami re-e uang chowm bowt. Now paw kawmpah hanow grep hown kowh thawpah mih tui sur kowi tawi tuk now tawi cha diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">Ngen iakmow miuüa re-e Ruth uang chowm hanow Boaz dow haiah mih chakkham Ruth kowi peah ne khai. Now naiawngün dow du pat aia cha kung kowi paw ta lat ne tak chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Nami kung kowi nacham kua iakmow iawk kownkow Ruth awr rü khe Boaz tek pe aia maru-uüa mih, “Iakmow cheng hownia aia paw iakmow püi khai chepaw aia kowi hangkow nangah büa diah. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Enni chengah mih iakmow cheng hownia aia vüi howkah now ta towla pe ne diah, now aia kowi pe lümah büa diah. Aia kowi hangkow nangah büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Ruth dow nami laih kowi sat kup dowi mowr krawi kua iakmow püi khai. Nami iakmow dow aia thuaah kung kowi khaiah pache hamüt set ngia chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Nami iakmow dow kua kowi aia kurla khai. Now anowkaw dow Ruth uang kuala mih iakmow hawt khi khai. Now ni-e khe kowh aia chak kung kowi kowh ta lat mih chakkham dow anowkaw kowi aia peah khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Ruth kowi anowkaw lüntaah mih, “Ani dow tawng kowi chow en cham kua? Tawng kowi chow en cham chang lup? Saksing sana en mih maru kowi dow Thurai pacham peah prasi lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Nakhowk khe mia laih kowi chow aia cham chang lup mih lawnguan anowkaw kowi lawp pe khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Ang chang pe lup mih laih iah ming dow Boaz chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Naomi tek pe aiaumow mih, “Kawmat kowh sing uowi miuüa hai kowng khowk miuüa luk kowi kaah sakowm iawng chang pe reng mih CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi pacham peah prasi lah,” pakhai. Nami klen kowi Naomi plan tek mih, “Nami maru dow a-i hown tasin taken mih chekhai. Aia dow ang hua takcha a-i kimchak kowi nalawng kownkow <char style="w">kurdik</char> uowi mih maru chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Moab chenchap Ruth tek pe mih, “Nami klen kowi aia tek ang mih, ‘Ang kowh iakmow ngen khowk dowi mowr dow ang kowh maru-uüa hown tawi uowi towbowt,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Nakhowk khe aiaumow kowi Naomi tek pe mih, “Iung khowk. Aia kowh lup chang mih masiuüa hawmh hown en tawi taiua uowi mih nalang iung kown. Nahanow akeng mih maru-uüa naia pusa en kown nadowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Naiawng rakowi iakmow hai püm ngen khowk dowi mowr Ruth dow Boaz kowh lup chang mih masiuüa hawmh kung kowi tawi kua püm hai iakmow püi khai. Nami khin khe aia dow anowkaw hown taiua uowi khai.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Boaz kowh te kowi Ruth kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Pre sum ni kung kowi Naomi tek pe Ruth mih, “Iauchow ow, en plan chang dawngthawng iawk e en matia vüi naiung kown. En vüi ang krawi cham en hua lowk ia e iung kown nadowi bow? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Ni towng en kowtawi kua pe iakmow püi reng mih laih kowi kowh chang lup mih masiuüa hawmh dow Boaz kowh narmauüa chekhai. Boaz dow anging hown kowh tasin taken mih maru. Sünta, aiak dow aiamat te kowi aia nathua iakmow kown. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Naiawng rakowi lu tui lu lam now phawkta unsi paingbawng kaneu, now tawnguat klangiungma mih khupla hanow aia te kowi kowkowi diah. Tawkchedow aia ki cha ki kham dowi mowr mapaw khi en dowi iawng en nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Now aia mawk khowk khe aia mawk rah mih müah kaneu diah. Now akung kowi dow aia mawk rah kowi kowkowiah now aia khupah mih uanchow khawk hownia lowtah now aia khawk daw kowi kowtawi mawk diah. Nakhowk khe tawng chow achang takla mih aia natek en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Now Ruth klangah mih, “En tek iawng ang nachang kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Akung kowi aia dow Boaz te kowi kowkowiah now anowkaw pe changah iawng rowprowp kowchang khai bowt.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Ki cha ki kham prowng kung kowi saktuak sowrchow khe Boaz dow iakmow chun ria kowi kowmawk now amüi khai bowt. Nami khin khe Ruth dow salow salowchow kowkowiah now Boaz khawk luk kowi kowh uanchow kowlowt khai, now aia dow nami re-e kowtawi mawk khai. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Now uar dawng khe Boaz dow awr süng hanow paipra kowi hairengkeng khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow aia khawk ria kowi masiuüa tawi mawk lowk ia mih khita khai. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Nakhowk khe aia lüntaah mih, “Mia chow en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Now Ruth klangah mih, “Ang dow en kowh narma Ruth taih. En dow ang hown tasin taken mih maru chekhai. En luk kowi dow naming nakhet ang kown mih kurdik uowi. Naiawng rakowi en napaw ang kurdik kown mih amat müa iawng hai en kowh uanchow hown khu ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Nakhowk khe Boaz tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en prasi lah. Kawmat mowr kowi Naomi tut-e kaah sakowmma en uowi lak-e kawmat kowh en changah mih lup dow kaah sakowm mih rah lang uowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kureng ngarai tawng iawng mih klanguüa kung paw en cham krawi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Naiawng rakowi hangkow kram diah. En nau iawng ang nachang en kown taih. En dow masiuüa iungma pami anging kuachak tuk bowk chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />En tasin taken miuüa pungmadawng kowi naming nakhet en kown mih kurdik ang luk kowi uowi nowm chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw ang lak-e kowh en hown lang tasin taken mih maru uowi lowk ia tak. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Aiak dow mami re-e iak diah towbowt. Tharau khe en lang tasin taken mih maru naming nakhet en kown mih kurdik nau paw panü dow naiung kown. Nachenganchepaw masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk, aia che nau paw kurdik dowi hanow naming nakhet en kown mih kurdik dow ang paw sow. Uarthowi dowi mowr mami re-e uowi diah towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Naiawng rakowi Ruth dow uarthowi dowi mowr Boaz khawk ria kowi tawi mawk khai, now aia dow uarthowi how thowi dowi how tak khe rik rü now powt khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi Boaz tek pe mih, “Te kowi masiuüa uang tawi iak lowk ia pami miapaw tuk dowi iawng ba,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15-16" />Powt kown chowbowt khe Ruth kowi Boaz tek pe mih, “En kowh uanchow uang pawla now uang phat madiah,” pakhai. Now Ruth dow Boaz tek iawng chang khai. Nakhowk khe Boaz mih Ruth kowh uanchow kowi krawi thup pe iakmow taruk tung khai. Now nami iakmow thup mih lu kowi klowngla now Ruth dow kim prakowi mang khai bowt. Now kim kowi Ruth kowting khe anowkaw Naomi hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawng iawng chow, iauchow ow?” pakhai. Now Ruth dow aia vüi kowi kowh Boaz chang pe mih maten anowkaw kowi lawp pe khai. <verse eid="RUT 3:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Nami klen kowi aia plan tek pe mih, “Mow, iakmow paw uang krawi pe ang taruk tung. Aia tek ang mih, ‘Rut khawma hown en nawkaw tut-e en hangkow mang diah,’ pah ang khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Naomi tek mih, “Mü ba iauchow ow, ani ngengche mami lawnguan kowi asia nadowi now asia aia chang en dowi matchang Boaz nauowi phülü kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boaz hai Ruth iüah tachawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boaz dow marow <char style="w">tapplawt</char> kowi kowh arasang maru kawmuüa takua talawmra kowi kowkowi hanow kowchowm khai. Nakhowk khe Elimelek hown lang tasin taken mih maru nami tiama iawng haimang khai. Naiawng rakowi Boaz hawah now tek pe mih, “Tainau, mami re-e uang chowm diah,” pakhai. Nahanow nami maru mih kowkowi hanow kowchowm khai.<verse eid="RUT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Nami kung kowi Boaz dow marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi hawah hamüt ia khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Chowm büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow kowbüah dow chowm khai. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Nakhowk khe Elimelek hown lang tasin taken mih maru kowi Boaz tek pe mih, “Moab pren hownia Naomi uang plan khowk. Aia mih a-i kowh tainau Elimelek hownia kowh kaah mih krawng bawn sumta kown pe. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Naiawng rakowi nami lawnguan pe tuk pe tala en kown takla padow ang tatuak khai. En mih mami re-e kowh maru kawmuüa pur kowi hai ang chennawi kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa pur kowi nami krawng bawn en che nau now ran diah. Tawkche en che ran kown nau dowi hanow tek ang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami krawng bawn naran kown mih alow lang uowi mih dow en chekhai, now ang dow en kung kowi chiang,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Nakhowk khe nami maru tek pe mih, “Ow, ang ran kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Nakhowk khe Boaz tek pe mih, “Naomi hownia nami krawng bawn en ran mih ni khe Moab chenchap Ruth kowi paw en nachawng kown takla. Nahanow en hown kowh Ruth nakaah kown mih chapa dow Ruth kowh kowng mih hua ming hai dawngthawnguan mih naia ta powng town kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Now Naomi kowi ta ming ta khet kownkow alow uowi mih maru tek mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow nami krawng bawn ang ia ran dowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dawngthawnguan dow ang matia kowh chauüa naka powng kown nadowi. Ang ia ran dowk chedow en matia ran towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Ari arow kowi uowi iawng ran dawngthawnguan hai tasum taran dawngthawnguan khai hanow achük alai khe kowh Israeluüa dow maiawng hai chang büah khai: Asum miia mih aia kowh phanaikhawk klüpah apra hanow aran miia kowi peah reng chekhai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa mih naiawng mih lawnguan kowi churah reng chekhai. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Naiawng rakowi nami maru tek pe Boaz mih, “En ran diah towbowt,” pakhai. Nahanow nami maru dow aia kowh phanaikhawk klüpah apra hanow Boaz kowi ap pe khai.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Nakhowk khe lawngtang aluchowuüa hai nami re-e kowh maru maten kowi Boaz tek pe mih, “Elimelek, Kiliawn hai Malawn büah kowh dawngthawnguan maten mih Naomi hownia ani mih ang ranta khowk pami saksi dow enni uowi khowk. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Now kowng mih maru kowh ming hai dawngthawnguan naia townla reng kownkow Malawn kowh masi Moab chenchap Ruth kowi paw ang nachangla masi kownkow ang ranta khowk. Nahanow ang hown kowh Ruth nakaah kown mih chapa dow ahua kowh ming hai dawngthawnguan naia town kown towbowt. Naiawngün lawnguan kowi kowh saksi dow ani mih enni tawi uowi khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Now lawngtang aluchowuüa hai marow tapplawt re-e kowh uowi miuüa maten tek mih, “Ow, saksi dow anging uowi chow. CHAKRAMANG dow en kowh masi kowi mih Rahel hai Leah iüah kowi kowh iawng ahuma pacham pe kaah chauüa lah. Israel krungchakuüa dow Rahel hai Leah iüah hownia kowh chekhai. En dow Efrat krungchak pungmadawng kowi kowh kurengma mih maru iawng pacham kureng lah, now Bethlehem kowi dow en kowh ming iung nang iung pacham tahowng lah. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Nami masiuüa hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG nape en kown mih krungchak dow Juda hai Tamar iüah kowh chapa Perez krungchak iawng pacham phaw lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boaz kowh krungchak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Naiawng rakowi Boaz dow aia kim kowi Ruth kowi pawla khai, now Ruth dow aia kowh masi uang chowng khai bowt. Now Boaz dow Ruth hown taphua taiua hanow CHAKRAMANG mih Ruth kowi pe kumah nau khai, now Ruth dow ka chapa lowk ia khai. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Naiawng rakowi akeng mih masiuüa hawmh tek pe Naomi mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah! Tawngplawng kowchow panow naming nakhet en kownkow aia dow pe ka en chu lowk ia khai. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi en chu kowh ming iung nang iung dow pacham tahowng lah. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Aia dow en vüi chownglawng sar pauang cham pawla en lah, now en lawngtang khe pat aia dow pacham mingkhet en lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow en kowh iaumow penah mih chapa chekhai. En kowh iaumow dow lainowmma sakrau en khai; aia dow chapa uowi ranit ia mih lak-e en tut-e lang iung chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi dow nami ngeuüa kowi paiah khai, now mingah khetah khai bowt. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Now aia kimping namkhet masiuüa hawmh tek mih, “Naomi ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia le!” pabüah khai. Amatni dow nami kachakuüa chah kowi Obed pahai rük pe ming khai. Obed kowh chapa dow Jese, now Jese kowh chapa dow David chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Mami dow Perez krungchakuüa chekhai. Perez kowh chapa dow Hezrawn; <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hezrawn kowh chapa dow Ram; Ram kowh chapa dow Aminadab; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadab kowh chapa dow Nasawn; Nasawn kowh chapa dow Salmawn; <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmawn kowh chapa dow Boaz, Boaz kowh chapa dow Obed; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obed kowh chapa dow Jese; now Jese kowh chapa dow David chekhai.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>